			"offsets": {
				"from": 0,
				"to": 9560
			},
			"text": " Hi, just a quick second channel video because somebody asked about this on my latest Blab video on the main channel."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:09,660",
				"to": "00:00:18,380"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 9660,
				"to": 18380
			},
			"text": " They wanted to know about these acoustic panels that I've made and how I actually made them, where I got them from."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:18,380",
				"to": "00:00:29,380"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 18380,
				"to": 29380
			},
			"text": " Now, I've actually done a video on, not these ones, but I've done another one, which is over here, EEVblog number 172."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:30,280",
				"to": "00:00:36,960"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 30280,
				"to": 36960
			},
			"text": " If you go check that out, I actually have made these ones here."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:37,260",
				"to": "00:00:42,600"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 37260,
				"to": 42600
			},
			"text": " Let me show you. I made these funky looking ones with the fabric."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:42,600",
				"to": "00:00:47,660"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 42600,
				"to": 47660
			},
			"text": " These have got special acoustic foam in them. They're more complicated to make."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:48,340",
				"to": "00:00:50,540"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 48340,
				"to": 50540
			},
			"text": " They're a wooden frame and everything else."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:50,720",
				"to": "00:00:56,020"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 50720,
				"to": 56020
			},
			"text": " So, I've done a video on that. Go check it out. I'll link it in down below."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:56,980",
				"to": "00:00:59,840"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 56980,
				"to": 59840
			},
			"text": " But, they asked about these ones."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:59,940",
				"to": "00:01:12,280"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 59940,
				"to": 72280
			},
			"text": " Now, I actually use these in my lab. I've actually made a whole bunch of them and they're really incredibly easy to make."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:12,280",
				"to": "00:01:13,540"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 72280,
				"to": 73540
			},
			"text": " Let's go over and have a look."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:14,520",
				"to": "00:01:19,220"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 74520,
				"to": 79220
			},
			"text": " I actually bought these on eBay. You can just buy the foam tiles."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:19,360",
				"to": "00:01:25,880"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 79360,
				"to": 85880
			},
			"text": " They're 300mm by 300mm, 30 by 30cm and they're all black."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:26,140",
				"to": "00:01:29,620"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 86140,
				"to": 89620
			},
			"text": " I think I got them from an Australian supplier. I'm not sure if they came from overseas."
